comments.message:
Thank you for adding all these test variations.

Within the repository our goal is to have one TEST method for each public method being tested.

So could you group all of the constructor tests into one TEST named Constructor?

e.g.
```
TEST_F(GpioTests, Constructor)
{
  // Test where Direction is Input, Polarity is Low, Default not specified
  {
    // ... details
  }

  // Test where Direction is Output, Polarity is High, Default not specified
  {
    // ... details
  }
}
```

The purpose of having a set of braces for each variation is it makes each one a separate scope so you can reuse the same local variable names for each variation. (e.g. you don't have to have gpio1, gpio2, ...
